### mu- stopping in the target of geom_tofmeter_example.mac (illustrative layout).
### Only mu- with kinetic energy below 0.5 GeV are generated - the ones that can
### stop behind the lead layer - and the live time counts exactly those.
### Spectrum: EXPACS table by default; add /tof/cosmic/model guan for the Guan formula.
### Analysis:  root -l -b -q 'analysis/stops_summary.C("output/stopping_example.root")'

/control/execute macro/geom_tofmeter_example.mac

/OutputFormat 1
/EventFilter 1
/OutputDirectory output
/OutputFile stopping_example
/gun/seed 3

/GeneralParticleSource 2
/tof/cosmic/planeCenter 0 0 35 cm
/tof/cosmic/halfX 60 cm
/tof/cosmic/halfY 60 cm
/tof/cosmic/thetaMax 60 deg
/tof/cosmic/energyMin 0 GeV
/tof/cosmic/energyMax 0.5 GeV
/tof/cosmic/species mu-
/tof/cosmic/charge mu-

/run/beamOn 500000
